### ========================================
### Wizard Assessment API - Test Requests
### ========================================
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5173
@contentType = application/json

### ========================================
### FLOW 1: Regular Flow - Small Startup (No Environments)
### Organization: 1 - Small Startup (No Env)
### Path: OrgSize -> Startup -> Recommended: Lite
### ========================================

### 1.1 Start Wizard for Small Startup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wizard/start
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "organizationId": 1
}

### RESPONSE: Will return OrgSize question
### Copy the sessionId from response and use it below

### 1.2 Answer OrgSize = "Small"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wizard/sessions/YOUR_SESSION_ID_HERE/answer
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "questionCode": "OrgSize",
  "answer": "Small"
}

### RESPONSE: Will return Startup question

### 1.3 Answer Startup = "Yes"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wizard/sessions/YOUR_SESSION_ID_HERE/answer
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "questionCode": "Startup",
  "answer": "Yes"
}

### RESPONSE: Will return isCompleted=true, recommendedBucket="Lite"


### ========================================
### FLOW 2: Environment Selection Flow
### Organization: 4 - Large Corp (With Env)
### Path: OrgSize (Large) -> EnvSelection -> Recommended: Lite/Medium/Premium (based on selection)
### ========================================

### 2.1 Start Wizard for Large Corp with Environments
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wizard/start
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "organizationId": 4
}

### RESPONSE: Will return OrgSize question
### Copy the sessionId from response

### 2.2 Answer OrgSize = "Large"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wizard/sessions/YOUR_SESSION_ID_HERE/answer
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "questionCode": "OrgSize",
  "answer": "Large"
}

### RESPONSE: Will return EnvSelection question with dynamic options from organization's environments
### Options will be: Production, Staging, Development, QA

### 2.3 Answer EnvSelection - Select 2 environments (Medium bucket)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wizard/sessions/YOUR_SESSION_ID_HERE/answer
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "questionCode": "EnvSelection",
  "answer": "Production,Staging"
}

### RESPONSE: Will return isCompleted=true, recommendedBucket="Medium" (2-3 environments)


### ========================================
### FLOW 3: Environment Flow (No Pre-existing Environments)
### Organization: 3 - Large Corp (No Env)
### Path: OrgSize (Large) -> Environments -> Recommended: Premium
### ========================================

### 3.1 Start Wizard for Large Corp without Environments
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wizard/start
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "organizationId": 3
}

### RESPONSE: Will return OrgSize question
### Copy the sessionId from response

### 3.2 Answer OrgSize = "Large"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wizard/sessions/YOUR_SESSION_ID_HERE/answer
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "questionCode": "OrgSize",
  "answer": "Large"
}

### RESPONSE: Will return Environments question (since org has no environments)

### 3.3 Answer Environments = "4-10" (Premium bucket)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wizard/sessions/YOUR_SESSION_ID_HERE/answer
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "questionCode": "Environments",
  "answer": "4-10"
}

### RESPONSE: Will return isCompleted=true, recommendedBucket="Premium"


### ========================================
### FLOW 4: Coverage Flow - Medium Organization
### Organization: 2 - Medium Business
### Path: OrgSize (Medium) -> Coverage -> Environments -> Recommended: Medium
### ========================================

### 4.1 Start Wizard for Medium Business
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wizard/start
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "organizationId": 2
}

### RESPONSE: Will return OrgSize question

### 4.2 Answer OrgSize = "Medium"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wizard/sessions/YOUR_SESSION_ID_HERE/answer
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "questionCode": "OrgSize",
  "answer": "Medium"
}

### RESPONSE: Will return Coverage question

### 4.3 Answer Coverage = "Most departments"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wizard/sessions/YOUR_SESSION_ID_HERE/answer
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "questionCode": "Coverage",
  "answer": "Most departments"
}

### RESPONSE: Will return Environments question

### 4.4 Answer Environments = "2-3" (Medium bucket)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wizard/sessions/YOUR_SESSION_ID_HERE/answer
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "questionCode": "Environments",
  "answer": "2-3"
}

### RESPONSE: Will return isCompleted=true, recommendedBucket="Medium"


### ========================================
### Additional Test Cases
### ========================================

### Test: Get Swagger UI
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger/index.html

### Test: Invalid Organization ID (should return 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wizard/start
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "organizationId": 999
}

### Test: Invalid Session ID (should return 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wizard/sessions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/answer
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "questionCode": "OrgSize",
  "answer": "Small"
}

### Test: Wrong Question Code (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wizard/sessions/YOUR_SESSION_ID_HERE/answer
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "questionCode": "InvalidQuestion",
  "answer": "SomeAnswer"
}

